=== PARITY (vs web ChargingSessionDetailWidget.tsx) ===
  Data sources -> bound via the shared state-holder seam (ChargingDetailSource ->
    ChargingDetailModel): useVehicles, useChargingSessions, useChargingSessionDetail,
    useChargeTelemetry, useTranslation. The production app wires ChargingDetailSource over the
    P1/S8 charging stores (sessions list -> latest-by-startedAt -> detail + telemetry for that
    session id). The view performs NO HTTP — no transport in the view (ADR-002/009).
  Projection -> 1:1 ports of the web memos:
    latestSessionId  -> ChargingProjection.latestSession (reduce by startedAt; nil when empty).
    chartData        -> chartPoints (nullable power_kw / battery_level??soc preserved; HH:mm label).
    peakPower        -> peakPowerKw (max power_kw ?? 0, floor 0).
    durationStr      -> ChargingDetailFormat.durationLabel (nil->em-dash; <60 -> Xm; else Xh Ym/Xh).
    energy           -> energyKwh (convertEnergyFromSI total_energy_added_wh -> kWh, /1000).
    classifyCharger  -> ChargerClass.classify (null/""->AC/Home; supercharger|tesla->Supercharger;
                        other non-empty/!<invalid>->DC Fast; <invalid>->AC/Home; warning vs neutral).
    All verified by EXECUTED XCTest (testClassify*, testLatestSession*, testPeakPower*,
    testEnergyKwh*, testDurationLabel*, testScale*).
  Chart (web <ComposedChart>: Area power left-axis [0,dataMax+5] + dashed Line SoC right-axis [0,100])
    -> Swift Charts single Chart: AreaMark (gradient #22c55e) + LineMark stroke + dashed LineMark SoC
       mapped into power space by ChargeChartScale, with a trailing axis that reads back in percent
       (MotorHistoryChart dual-axis idiom). X = HH:mm; isWide drives tick density (6 vs 4).
  States (every one renders — no hidden surfaces):
    loading -> skeleton chrome (stat + chart skeletons; compact single)        [web WidgetShell loading]
    empty   -> ChargeEmptyState "No charge sessions" (bolt icon)               [web !detail EmptyState]
    error   -> QueryError-equivalent (icon + title + message + Retry)          [prompt-required + web error]
    content -> compact (big kWh + "kWh added" + charger badge) OR standard
               (2-col stat grid + dual-axis chart + legend; no-telemetry note
                when detail present but no plottable samples)                   [web isCompact / standard]
    freshness chip (header): live / stale / offline — tappable refresh;
      stale -> auto-refresh; compact = title-less                              [web DataFreshness / WidgetShell]
